  "body": "Viewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nOften sought, seldom found — don’t miss this rare opportunity!\r\nOffered to the market for the first time in 21 years by its original owners.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned on a sunny flat 675sqm (mol) section in Mixed Housing Suburban Zone with approx 180sqm living space, this elegant single-level solid home will impress even the most discerning buyers. Offering 3 generous double bedrooms, 1 study room, 2 spacious living areas, a separate dining room, 2 bathrooms, and a double internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nWithin walking distance to Half Moon Bay Marina, local shops, and parks, and zoned for the highly coveted Macleans College — this home is the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and top-tier education in the prime area of Half Moon Bay.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a bright, open-plan lounge — an inviting space for entertaining or relaxing. Adjacent lies the dining area, a warm spot for shared meals and family moments. The spacious kitchen features ample storage with the garden view and connects seamlessly to the family room, creating the ultimate hub for everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom wing is thoughtfully separated from the main living areas to ensure peace and privacy. The master suite boasts a modern ensuite, walk-in wardrobe, and effortless flow to the backyard. The remaining two bedrooms are well-sized and share a family bathroom with a separate toilet.  A study room is a bonus for those working from home, while a dedicated laundry room adds further practicality.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the outdoor living with a large, sun-drenched patio — perfect for summer barbecues and weekend gatherings. The fully fenced backyard offers a private haven for children and pets to play safely. Garden enthusiasts will love the vegetable patch and established trees and flowers that complete this delightful setting.\r\n\r\nWithin walking distance to Half Moon Bay Ferry, a few minutes' drive to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Pak’n Save, Lloyd Elsmore Park, zoned for top-tier schools including Macleans College, BBI, Pigeon Mountain Primary School, Farm Cove Intermediate and Pakuranga College, this property checks all the boxes for convenience, quality living and education.\r\n\r\nHomes like this don’t come along often — act fast! Call us today or visit our open homes to experience it!",
